<title>POLAND: Okocim plunges 9.5 pct ahead of results.</title>
<headline>Okocim plunges 9.5 pct ahead of results.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brewer Okocim SA tumbled 9.5 percent to 17.2 zlotys in a moderate turnover and some analysts said expectations of poor February results might have hit the stock.</p>
<p>They said there were no fundamental factors in sight to justify such a drop other than speculation that it would show poor earnings in its monthly report due later on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;I see no fundamental reason for the fall but maybe some investors expect poor February earnings,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
